{'symbol': 'K', 'date': '2022-09-21 09:01:00', 'title': "KELLOGG® AND LITTLE DEBBIE® RECREATE CHILDHOOD MEMORIES AT THE BREAKFAST TABLE WITH NEW KELLOGG'S® LITTLE DEBBIE® NUTTY BUDDY® CEREAL", 'text': "FROM THE CREATORS OF COSMIC® BROWNIES AND OATMEAL CREME PIES CEREALS, KELLOGG AND LITTLE DEBBIE® ADD ANOTHER NOSTALGIA-INDUCING CEREAL TO THEIR LINEUP BATTLE CREEK, MICH. , SEPT. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KELLOGG'S® AND LITTLE DEBBIE® ARE BRINGING BACK SWEET MOMENTS OF NOSTALGIA BY EXPANDING THEIR LINEUP OF CLASSIC TREAT-INSPIRED CEREALS WITH THEIR LATEST COLLAB: KELLOGG'S® LITTLE DEBBIE® NUTTY BUDDY® CEREAL."}